{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/208bab76b859f1efe590a289684c6912.poster.avif?t=1771050864\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/208bab76b859f1efe590a289684c6912.webm?t=1771050864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/208bab76b859f1efe590a289684c6912.mp4?t=1771050864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abashed is a 2.5D narrative-driven side-scrolling game that lets you explore the life of Issac, a man living with psychosis. One day, waking up all alone, he sets out to find the truth behind his missing partner. On the way he finds himself needing to confront his deepest fears and the darkest secrets. Join Issac in this story of love, loss, fear, and acceptance. Reality is not what it seems. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/0506e92ec27cad016badad1960e6eca1.webp?t=1771050864\" width=609 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/688a650b030ff22992a840ff3076f49f.poster.avif?t=1771050864\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/688a650b030ff22992a840ff3076f49f.webm?t=1771050864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/688a650b030ff22992a840ff3076f49f.mp4?t=1771050864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume medication to alter reality that changes the environment around you for a limited period. Use this to your advantage to unlock hidden areas, find clues, and solve puzzles.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/feb235dfbe7a840ce3d15da1a513b135.webp?t=1771050864\" width=609 height=42 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/9371facf53a020f5cd7fc834fb8f40c4.poster.avif?t=1771050864\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/9371facf53a020f5cd7fc834fb8f40c4.webm?t=1771050864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/9371facf53a020f5cd7fc834fb8f40c4.mp4?t=1771050864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique interconnected puzzles that let you take advantage of your power to find interesting solutions. Manipulate your surroundings and unlock hidden truths as you journey deeper into the unknown. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/c71bdc76ad480907f4d2d9840b2304d5.webp?t=1771050864\" width=609 height=42 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological adventure</strong> set in the mind of Issac, where the line between the real and the surreal blurs.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that involve altering reality, manipulating the environment, collecting and using items you find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter interesting characters, each with their own traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a narrative rich with emotional depth, exploring themes of mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a unique hand-made art style and hauntingly beautiful environments.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3116230?t=1771050864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3116230?t=1771050864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/0db17e6af4f7592e8faf7669eb65e92302c5a361/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771050864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/0db17e6af4f7592e8faf7669eb65e92302c5a361/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771050864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work, including: Blood, Psychological horror and Social themes (references to mental health issues), Some Violence or Gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3458700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST NOW AND JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116230/extras/209023d20d048cffb39929881549e199.poster.avif?t=1771050864\" width=800 height=66